<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Coupon</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#0e0e0e;color:#fff;font-family:-apple-system,Roboto,Arial;padding-bottom:140px}
.header{background:#1c1c1c;height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a2a}
.header .icons{position:absolute;right:12px;display:flex;gap:16px;color:#888;font-size:20px}
.card{background:#1c1c1c;margin:10px 8px;border-radius:12px;padding:0 0 8px;border:1px solid #262626}
.card-top{padding:10px 12px 8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#7a7a7a}
.card-top span:last-child{color:#4a8bd1;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}
.teams{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:6px 14px 10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2}
.teams .center{font-weight:900;font-size:15px}
.teams img{width:30px;height:30px;object-fit:contain}
.type{margin:0 8px;background:#252525;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#8a8a8a;font-size:12.5px}
.type b{color:#fff;font-size:14px}
.summary{position:fixed;bottom:66px;left:0;right:0;background:#1c1c1c;padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a}
.summary-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.summary-row small{color:#8a8a8a;font-size:12px}
.summary-row b{font-size:15px}
.btn{margin-top:12px;width:100%;background:#3aaa35;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5ec95a,#3aaa35);border:0;padding:15px;border-radius:12px;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.3px}
.bottom{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:66px;background:#1c1c1c;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;align-items:center}
.bottom div{text-align:center;color:#6e6e6e;font-size:10px;line-height:1.1}
.bottom div.active{color:#4a8bd1}
.bottom span{font-size:22px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
.badge{position:absolute;background:#e53935;color:#fff;font-size:9px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;top:-4px;right:-6px}
.wrap-icon{position:relative;display:inline-block}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">Combiné ∨ <div class="icons"><span>🗑</span><span>⋮</span></div></div>

<div class="card">
<div class="card-top"><span>⚽ 03.11.2026 (18:45)</span><span>✕</span></div>
<div class="teams">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F123.png"> Galatasaray</div>
<div class="center">VS</div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">VfB Stuttgart <img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F131.png"></div>
</div>
<div class="type"><span>Temps réglementaire, 1X2: X</span><b>4.315</b></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="card-top"><span>⚽ 03.11.2026 (18:45)</span><span>✕</span></div>
<div class="teams">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F12321.png"> Shakhtar<br>Donetsk</div>
<div class="center">VS</div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">Sporting Clube<br>de Portugal <img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F2250.png"></div>
</div>
<div class="type"><span>Temps réglementaire, 1X2: V1</span><b>3.635</b></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="card-top"><span>⚽ 03.11.2026 (21:00)</span><span>✕</span></div>
<div class="teams">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F1068.png"> Atlético de<br>Madrid</div>
<div class="center">VS</div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">Bayern Munich <img src="https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fi%2Fteamlogos%2Fsoccer%2F500%2F132.png"></div>
</div>
<div class="type"><span>Temps réglementaire, 1X2: V1</span><b>2.864</b></div>
</div>

<div class="summary">
<div class="summary-row">
<div><small>🎫 3</small><br><small>Cote : <b style="color:#fff;font-size:16px">44.921</b></small><br><small>Si la cote change <span style="color:#5aa9e6">Me demander de confirmer</span></small></div>
<div style="font-size:22px;color:#888">⚙️</div>
</div>
<button class="btn">Pari</button>
</div>

<div class="bottom">
<div><span>🔥</span>Populaire</div>
<div><span>⭐</span>Favoris</div>
<div class="active"><span class="wrap-icon">🎟️<span class="badge">3</span></span><br>Coupon</div>
<div><span>🕒</span>Historique</div>
<div><span>⊞</span>Menu</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
